          "rule_source": "Sigma Integrated Rule Set (GitHub)",
          "rule_title": "Remove Scheduled Cron Task/Job",
          "rule_description": "Detects usage of the 'crontab' utility to remove the current crontab.\nThis is a common occurrence where cryptocurrency miners compete against each other by removing traces of other miners to hijack the maximum amount of resources possible\n",
